          "content": "Centered in the window over the 60% scrim, like every other confirm. Both triggers open the same dialog in the same state; click outside, Escape, or Later closes it and a download keeps running. Variations inside a state, not new states: Available hides Download when the release has no .sig; Failed's body names what failed (download, signature, or installer) and Retry restarts the right step.",
